# Optional overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to .dev.vars).
#
# Nothing here is required. The CMS mints its own session-signing secrets on
# first run and stores them in the database, so a fresh install needs no
# hand-generated values. Set these only to pin the secrets yourself — e.g. to
# keep sessions valid across a database reset — and use `wrangler secret put`
# for the deployed Worker rather than this file.
#
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=random-32-plus-chars
# READER_SESSION_SECRET=random-32-plus-chars
